  "datatype": "code",
  "cardinality": "multiple",
  "scope": "surface",
  "valueDomain": "https://ptpge.org/v1/printing/standards/color-systems/color-matching-systems",
  "codePattern": "^[a-z0-9][a-z0-9-]*$",
  "scopeNote": {
    "en": "Written as <matching-system term>/<code>, the code lower-cased with spaces as hyphens: Pantone 300 C → …/pantone-matching-system/300-c; HKS 43 K → …/hks/43-k; RAL 5015 → …/ral/5015. The number of spot-ink values on a face must equal the number of spot-color layers bound there; the specification sets no upper limit — the press does (vendor-declaration/1 inkStations).",
    "nb": "Skrives som <matchingsystem-term>/<kode>, koden i små bokstaver med mellomrom som bindestrek: Pantone 300 C → …/pantone-matching-system/300-c; HKS 43 K → …/hks/43-k; RAL 5015 → …/ral/5015. Antall spot-ink-verdier på en flate må være lik antall spotfargelag bundet der; spesifikasjonen setter ingen øvre grense — det gjør pressen (vendor-declaration/1 inkStations)."
  },
